If the Zero Depreciation add-on is active and the vehicle qualifies, the depreciation step is skipped and gross damage equals eligible damage. If the Return-to-Invoice add-on is active and total loss is declared, the eligible damage is the original invoice value rather than the ACV. These two modifications are the most common departures from the standard formula.

